by the FFmpeg contributors (https://ffmpeg.org/). The Alpine 6.1.2 binaries
report GPL-3.0-or-later with `ffmpeg -L`; COPYING.GPL-3.0 is included alongside
this notice. Separately packaged libraries retain their respective licenses.
Corresponding FFmpeg source is available at
https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-6.1.2.tar.xz. Alpine's build recipes,
dependencies and patches are at
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports/-/tree/3.22-stable/community/ffmpeg.
Additional upstream licensing information is at https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html.
The development container uses Debian's separately packaged FFmpeg build.
